04:09.730 --> 04:11.560
<b><i>I'm not like them.</i></b>

04:12.360 --> 04:16.030
<b><i>I can unleash true terror that</i>
<i>will silence even these scumbags.</i></b>

04:17.320 --> 04:19.990
