MUNCH MUNCH</b>

05:11.620 --> 05:13.460
<b>CRUNCH CRUNCH
CHOMP CHOMP</b>

05:13.540 --> 05:16.420
<b>CHOMP CHOMP
MUNCH MUNCH</b>

05:20.380 --> 05:22.760
<b>GULP GULP</b>

05:23.010 --> 05:24.010
