05:30.060 --> 05:32.770
<b><i>I'm stuffed.</i>
<i>That was a meal fit for a baboon!</i></b>

05:33.270 --> 05:34.440
<b>Now then...</b>

05:36.570 --> 05:37.530
<b>Hm?</b>

05:38.940 --> 05:40.240
<b><i>My wallet's gone!</i></b>

05:41.740 --> 05:44.910
<b><i>Did I drop it back at the supermarket</i>
<i>when I bought napa cabbage?</i></b>

05:45.700 --> 05:47.080
<b><i>Oh...crap.</i></b>

05:47.950 --> 05:50.830
<b><i>I could call Genos,</i>
<i>but he's broken right now.</i></b>

05:53.880 --> 05:56.790
<b><i>This month's lunch special</i>
<i>is fried deep-sea fish.</i></b>

05:57.090 --> 05:59.460
<b><i>Although public safety is a concern</i></b>

05:59.460 --> 06:03.050
<b><i>our restaurant maintains</i>
<i>strict security measures</i></b>

06:03.050 --> 06:05.430
