<i>and dine-and-dash incidents.</i></b>

06:07.720 --> 06:11.140
<b><i>A former pro hero is also stationed</i>
<i>in our security office.</i></b>

06:11.270 --> 06:14.770
<b><i>So you can dine without worry.</i></b>

06:15.230 --> 06:18.480
<b><i>Damn... After hearing that announcement,</i>
<i>if I tell a waiter about my situation</i></b>

06:18.480 --> 06:20.820
