<i>I've faced all year.</i></b>

06:28.580 --> 06:29.410
<b><i>Hey you!</i></b>

06:29.410 --> 06:31.040
<b>This could be the end for me.</b>

06:31.040 --> 06:31.950
<b><i>I'm talking to you!</i></b>

06:32.830 --> 06:33.870
<b>Saitama!</b>

06:33.870 --> 06:36.330
<b>No, it's not what it looks like!
I was just...!</b>

06:36.630 --> 06:37.750
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

06:38.290 --> 06:40.710
<b>Huh? What're you doing here?</b>

06:41.010 --> 06:43.630
<b>Jeez, I looked all over
for you, Saitama!</b>

06:43.970 --> 06:46.800
<b>You left in the middle
of our conversation!</b>

06:47.180 --> 06:49.970
<b>So, you're looking for
the Hero Hunter, right?</b>

06:50.520 --> 06:53.940
<b>Fine then.
I'll help you out.</b>

06:54.310 --> 06:55.850
<b>Excuse me, I'd like to add to my order.</b>

06:55.850 --> 06:58.270
<b>- In return, I'm taking...
- One extra large fries.</b>

06:58.270 --> 06:59.980
<b>...70% of the points as a success fee.</b>

07:00.650 --> 07:04.280
<b>You've quickly risen to
Class B, Rank 7.</b>

07:04.280 --> 07:06.660
<b>But it'll be hard to climb
higher from there.</b>

07:07.450 --> 07:12.790
<b>If this goes well, reaching top five
of Class B is definitely possible.</b>

07:13.160 --> 07:17.330
<b>But for that,
you'll need my cooperation.</b>

07:17.830 --> 07:19.500
<b>You probably
don't even know anything</b>

07:19.500 --> 07:23.050
<b>about your target or
their facial features, right?</b>

07:23.130 --> 07:27.430
<b>Honestly, you're hopeless.
I'll provide you with the intel.</b>

07:27.510 --> 07:27.840
<b>DAZE</b>

07:27.840 --> 07:30.970
<b>DAZE
From now on, you will follow
my instructions and act accordingly...</b>

07:30.970 --> 07:31.720
<b>DAZE</b>

07:31.720 --> 07:32.810
<b>DAZE
You listening?</b>

07:32.810 --> 07:32.930
<b>DAZE</b>

07:33.220 --> 07:35.350
<b>Your fries, sir. Please enjoy.</b>

07:41.230 --> 07:42.190
<b>You're sharing with me?</b>

07:44.610 --> 07:45.490
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:51.450 --> 07:53.410
<b><i>What's with that grin?</i></b>

07:54.080 --> 07:57.000
<b><i>He must be thrilled to</i>
<i>be working with me.</i></b>

07:57.420 --> 08:00.330
<b><i>Maybe Saitama will now join</i>
<i>the Blizzard Bunch.</i></b>

08:00.420 --> 08:02.040
<b>A dine-and-dasher!</b>

08:02.170 --> 08:03.920
<b>But I haven't done it yet!</b>

08:04.050 --> 08:06.510
<b>Someone catch that guy!</b>

08:08.970 --> 08:10.470
<b>Dine and dashing is a terrible crime.</b>

08:10.470 --> 08:12.140
<b>- I'll go after him.
- Hey... Saitama?!</b>

08:12.180 --> 08:15.060
<b>You ate a fry, right?
The bill's on you!</b>

08:18.310 --> 08:22.650
<b><i>One...fry?</i>
<i>Are you kidding me?</i></b>

08:22.860 --> 08:25.230
<b><i>The world's falling apart and</i></b>

08:25.230 --> 08:27.240
<b><i>he's being this petty?</i></b>

08:30.160 --> 08:32.740
<b>Guess a marathon was still
a bit too much for me.</b>

08:34.290 --> 08:36.250
<b>It would be better to heal your wounds</b>

08:36.250 --> 08:38.460
<b>under the protection of
the Monster Association.</b>

08:38.790 --> 08:43.340
<b>But first, you'll need to
fulfill a condition.</b>

08:44.090 --> 08:46.630
<b>"Bring back a hero's head," huh...?</b>

08:47.300 --> 08:50.010
<b>So if you kill a hero,
you're officially considered a monster?</b>

08:50.010 --> 08:51.430
<b>What kind of logic is that?</b>

08:51.890 --> 08:57.020
<b>Monsters should be able to incite
absolute fear with their mere presence.</b>

08:58.940 --> 09:01.060
<b>Oh man, my head hurts...</b>

09:06.780 --> 09:07.990
<b>Who cares.</b>

09:11.740 --> 09:15.240
<b>Hey Tareo, how did you get out alive?</b>

09:15.370 --> 09:17.450
<b>Maybe you're a monster too!</b>

09:17.450 --> 09:19.620
<b>Yeah, an ugly monster!</b>

09:19.620 --> 09:21.830
<b>Oww, that hurts!</b>

09:25.340 --> 09:26.460
<b>Knock it off!</b>

09:27.380 --> 09:29.420
<b>- Mommy!
- Mommy!</b>

09:31.050 --> 09:33.260
<b>Look at that ugly cry-face.</b>

09:33.680 --> 09:36.310
<b>No wonder they bully you.
Poor kid.</b>

09:38.020 --> 09:41.140
<b>Hey, what are the odds
we meet twice on the same day.</b>

09:41.190 --> 09:42.020
<b>Old dude?!</b>

09:42.100 --> 09:42.140
<b>Don't call me, old. I'm only 18!</b>

09:42.140 --> 09:43.020
<b>SNAP
Don't call me, old. I'm only 18!</b>

09:43.020 --> 09:44.480
<b>Don't call me, old. I'm only 18!</b>

09:46.980 --> 09:49.280
<b>Hurry up and go home.
The sun's going down.</b>

09:49.740 --> 09:51.780
<b>Monsters might come out again.</b>

09:54.370 --> 09:55.530
<b>Old dude...</b>

09:56.990 --> 09:57.950
<b>Sorry...</b>

09:59.160 --> 10:01.210
<b>For running away earlier today.</b>

10:03.790 --> 10:04.630
<b>Huh?</b>

10:05.460 --> 10:08.130
<b>I saw everything...</b>

10:09.170 --> 10:15.050
<b>The heroes were trying to kill you,
but that was a mistake, right?</b>

10:15.430 --> 10:20.680
<b>After all, you protected me from
the bullets that time!</b>

10:21.100 --> 10:23.980
<b>And just now. You saved me again.</b>

10:24.690 --> 10:26.900
<b>I bet you're a champion of justice and—</b>

10:28.230 --> 10:31.070
<b>Cut it out.
You're giving me goosebumps.</b>

10:31.320 --> 10:33.030
<b>Hey, dine-and-dasher!</b>

10:34.200 --> 10:35.660
<b>Hey, dine-and-dasher!</b>

10:36.240 --> 10:38.410
<b>You scumbag!
How dare you leave without paying!</b>

10:38.450 --> 10:39.450
<b>Is that a hero?</b>

10:39.450 --> 10:41.950
<b>Your timing was perfect, you scumbag!</b>

10:41.950 --> 10:43.250
<b>So, I'll let it slide this time!</b>

10:43.330 --> 10:44.580
<b>Wait, what do you mean?</b>

10:44.580 --> 10:46.420
<b>Okay, so let this be your warning.</b>

10:46.830 --> 10:48.880
<b>Didn't you come to fight me?</b>

10:49.090 --> 10:51.880
<b>Are you scared now?
What's your hero name?</b>

10:57.220 --> 10:59.600
<b>Cape...Caped Baldy.</b>

11:00.140 --> 11:03.640
<b><i>Huh? I didn't catch that.</i>
<i>But he does look like a hero.</i></b>

11:04.520 --> 11:06.980
<b><i>He may be a small fry,</i>
<i>but I'll hunt any hero.</i></b>

11:07.900 --> 11:11.530
<b>He's not even in the Hero Almanac,
so I bet he's new.</b>

11:11.690 --> 11:13.110
<b>Go home, kid.</b>

11:14.990 --> 11:17.620
<b>Old dude... Did you dine and dash?</b>

11:17.990 --> 11:20.870
<b>He said he'll let it go,
so don't hassle him.</b>

11:24.500 --> 11:25.960
<b><i>What a joke.</i></b>

11:27.040 --> 11:29.210
<b><i>If I start getting pity</i>
<i>from the Monster Association</i></b>

11:29.210 --> 11:33.920
<b><i>and even from small-time heroes and brats,</i>
<i>then I'm really done for.</i></b>

11:34.920 --> 11:37.590
<b><i>When I heard that</i>
<i>the old geezer survived, I felt relieved.</i></b>

11:37.590 --> 11:40.050
<b><i>It makes me sick to think</i>
<i>that I felt that way.</i></b>

11:40.850 --> 11:42.810
<b><i>Whatever the definition of a monster is</i></b>

11:42.810 --> 11:45.850
<b><i>it's clear I don't have</i>
<i>the resolve to be one.</i></b>

11:46.690 --> 11:48.020
<b><i>I'll do it.</i></b>

11:48.600 --> 11:51.230
<b><i>If a hero's head is what you want,</i>
<i>I'll get you one.</i></b>

11:51.820 --> 11:55.150
<b><i>Don't underestimate me...</i>
<i>I'm a monster.</i></b>

11:57.360 --> 12:00.410
<b>Hey, you're mine!</b>

12:01.280 --> 12:04.370
<b>Sorry, I'm just as guilty as you,
so I can't be seen with you.</b>

12:10.290 --> 12:11.420
<b>Oops...</b>

12:12.590 --> 12:13.750
<b>I screwed up.</b>

12:14.630 --> 12:16.840
<b>I didn't mean to knock him out.</b>

12:18.090 --> 12:20.300
<b><i>Oh great, a witness.</i></b>

12:20.550 --> 12:21.680
<b><i>What's that book?</i></b>

12:22.180 --> 12:24.600
<b><i>Of all people, it had</i>
<i>to be some hero-obsessed kid.</i></b>

12:25.560 --> 12:28.940
<b><i>Guess my cover's blown.</i>
<i>Damn it.</i></b>

12:30.100 --> 12:32.400
<b>Hey kid, do you know who I am?</b>

12:34.480 --> 12:35.320
<b>Huh?</b>

12:35.740 --> 12:36.740
<b>HERO ALMANAC</b>

12:36.740 --> 12:38.150
<b>HERO ALMANAC
Let me take a look at that.</b>

12:38.150 --> 12:38.650
<b>HERO ALMANAC</b>

12:40.490 --> 12:41.410
<b>Are you serious?</b>

12:42.070 --> 12:43.490
<b>I'm not even listed in here.</b>

12:44.200 --> 12:45.160
<b>Figures...</b>

12:48.540 --> 12:49.870
<b><i>Who was that?</i></b>

12:50.920 --> 12:52.420
<b>I almost forgot!</b>

12:52.750 --> 12:53.710
<b>Old dude!</b>

12:53.710 --> 12:55.500
<b>Wake up, old dude!</b>

12:57.010 --> 12:58.170
<b>One-Punch Man!</b>

13:02.050 --> 13:03.300
<b>One-Punch Man!</b>

13:18.360 --> 13:20.110
<b>You okay, old dude?</b>

13:20.530 --> 13:24.580
<b>That bald hero guy said, "I screwed up"
and ran away.</b>

13:25.410 --> 13:28.620
<b>I lost...?!
W-What kind of hero was he?</b>

13:28.950 --> 13:30.540
<b>You don't remember?</b>

13:30.870 --> 13:32.880
<b>Maybe he hit your head in a bad spot.</b>

13:34.170 --> 13:38.090
<b>Garou, what's going on?</b>

13:42.260 --> 13:44.140
<b>We've been watching you the whole time.</b>

13:45.220 --> 13:48.770
<b>You're not like us, Garou.</b>

13:49.520 --> 13:52.940
<b>Yeah, that's right.
It's a shame but...</b>

13:53.270 --> 13:56.730
<b>You lack the qualities of
a true monster.</b>

13:58.650 --> 14:02.570
<b>Hey kid...
Stop staring and go home.</b>

14:03.360 --> 14:05.950
<b>These guys wanna have a word with me.</b>

14:06.370 --> 14:07.410
<b>Huh?</b>

14:15.380 --> 14:19.670
<b>He's in my almanac.
It wasn't just hearsay.</b>

14:21.380 --> 14:23.430
<b>W-What is he doing...here?</b>

14:23.430 --> 14:24.340
<b>URBAN LEGEND MONSTER
KING THE RIPPER
W-What is he doing...here?</b>

14:24.340 --> 14:24.970
<b>URBAN LEGEND MONSTER
KING THE RIPPER</b>

14:25.970 --> 14:30.270
<b>That's King the Ripper.
He's abducted many kids.</b>

14:31.270 --> 14:33.520
<b>It's King the Ripperrrr!!</b>

14:34.690 --> 14:36.360
<b>Hey! Pull yourself together!</b>

14:36.610 --> 14:38.230
<b>Stop crying and get up!</b>

14:38.360 --> 14:42.950
<b>Who knew you had such
a small friend, Garou.</b>

14:43.280 --> 14:45.450
<b>Hey, stop! Talk from over there!</b>

14:45.740 --> 14:48.120
<b>Oh my...sorry.</b>

14:48.580 --> 14:53.330
<b>I didn't mean to make you cry yet.
My bad.</b>

14:54.000 --> 14:58.960
<b>I was planning to savor
those screams later.</b>

14:59.210 --> 15:00.800
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

15:01.210 --> 15:02.970
<b>Ah, you poor thing.</b>

15:03.090 --> 15:06.590
<b>I'll make sure to chop up
every last inch of your body to pieces.</b>

15:06.590 --> 15:08.100
<b>Forgive me.</b>

15:09.890 --> 15:11.390
<b>Little boy...</b>

15:11.520 --> 15:14.440
<b>You're doomed. Sorry.</b>

15:16.150 --> 15:17.270
<b>Stay back.</b>

15:21.900 --> 15:22.780
<b>Pardon me.</b>

15:23.030 --> 15:24.320
<b>I'd like to ask a question.</b>

15:24.400 --> 15:27.910
<b>I hate to be interrupted
when I'm meditating. What is it?</b>

15:28.370 --> 15:31.080
<b>Why did you send King the Ripper
and Insect God?</b>

15:31.200 --> 15:32.580
<b>If it was just for observation</b>

15:32.620 --> 15:34.910
<b>you didn't need to send
those two brutes.</b>

15:35.160 --> 15:37.880
<b>Why not? They may actually
get along surprisingly well.</b>

15:37.880 --> 15:38.880
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

15:39.250 --> 15:41.710
<b>Those two never follow orders.</b>

15:41.880 --> 15:44.170
<b>They'll probably get carried away
and kill Garou.</b>

15:44.630 --> 15:48.390
<b>Especially King the Ripper.
He's a rare breed that kills for pleasure.</b>

15:48.590 --> 15:52.140
<b>Even the other monsters
won't go near him.</b>

15:52.350 --> 15:54.350
<b>Exactly, that was my point.</b>

15:54.480 --> 15:56.140
<b>I let them make contact with Garou</b>

15:56.140 --> 15:59.150
<b>so that it would stimulate him
and promote his growth.</b>

15:59.150 --> 16:00.150
<b>Growth?</b>

16:00.400 --> 16:03.650
<b>This is a trial for that indecisive boy.</b>

16:03.820 --> 16:07.360
<b>First, we need to
tear apart his body and his mind</b>

16:07.360 --> 16:08.820
<b>until they are in tatters...</b>

16:09.240 --> 16:11.700
<b>I look forward to seeing
how he changes</b>

16:11.700 --> 16:14.160
<b>after experiencing monsters firsthand.</b>

16:14.410 --> 16:17.290
<b>Gyoro-Gyoro, what are you after?</b>

16:17.540 --> 16:20.040
<b>What do you really intend
to do with Garou?</b>

16:20.290 --> 16:21.590
<b>Why are you asking?</b>

16:21.670 --> 16:23.800
<b>No reason. Just curious.</b>

16:23.880 --> 16:25.710
<b>Listen, Phoenix Man.</b>

16:25.840 --> 16:28.880
<b>Where do you think
Lord Orochi came from?</b>

16:29.130 --> 16:30.180
<b>I don't know...</b>

16:30.260 --> 16:32.260
<b>Isn't he an ancient creature
or something?</b>

16:33.430 --> 16:37.140
<b>Lord Orochi was once human like Garou.</b>

16:38.390 --> 16:42.900
<b>After countless failures and sacrifices,
he finally became the ultimate lifeform.</b>

16:43.110 --> 16:46.150
<b>He is truly worthy of
the name, Monster King.</b>

16:46.740 --> 16:49.200
<b>It was I who created Lord Orochi.</b>

16:49.320 --> 16:51.490
<b>Created? You did?</b>

16:51.620 --> 16:55.870
<b>If Garou is trained properly,
he might become a second Lord Orochi.</b>

16:56.040 --> 16:58.330
<b>Only I know the secret to do that.</b>

16:58.790 --> 17:01.330
<b>I've instructed Insect God to intervene</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.040
<b>if King the Ripper goes too far
with Garou.</b>

17:04.250 --> 17:07.050
<b>But if he dies,
then that's just how it goes.</b>

17:07.420 --> 17:10.720
<b>We'll just wait for the next
suitable specimen to show up.</b>

17:15.180 --> 17:17.980
<b><i>I scoped out the area and</i>
<i>sealed the back entrance.</i></b>

17:18.390 --> 17:21.100
<b><i>For the last few hours,</i>
<i>no one has come or gone but the gorilla.</i></b>

17:21.560 --> 17:24.940
<b><i>The other members are all out.</i>
<i>This is the perfect time.</i></b>

17:25.320 --> 17:27.480
<b><i>The command center is</i>
<i>probably located inside.</i></b>

17:27.610 --> 17:28.740
<b><i>Perhaps in the monitor room.</i></b>

17:29.450 --> 17:32.950
<b><i>A strange group of unidentified people</i>
<i>recently moved in.</i></b>

17:33.320 --> 17:35.620
<b><i>They've been bringing in</i>
<i>large amounts of equipment</i></b>

17:35.620 --> 17:36.830
<b><i>and mysterious powders...</i></b>

17:37.330 --> 17:39.790
<b><i>And boxes filled with putrid matter.</i></b>

17:40.160 --> 17:44.420
<b><i>The information I've gathered</i>
<i>matches my suspicions.</i></b>

17:45.250 --> 17:47.380
<b><i>No doubt about it.</i>
<i>It must be them.</i></b>

17:48.010 --> 17:50.380
<b><i>Now's the time. I'm going in.</i></b>

17:52.180 --> 17:57.060
<b>Gyoro-Gyoro ordered us to
observe your actions.</b>

17:57.180 --> 18:01.690
<b>To determine if you're truly worthy
of joining our ranks.</b>

18:13.320 --> 18:14.990
<b>Hero Hunter...</b>

18:15.120 --> 18:20.830
<b>Are you just some freak who gets off
on pretending to be a monster?</b>

18:21.080 --> 18:22.830
<b>Or are you a true monster?</b>

18:23.120 --> 18:25.580
<b>Hmph. Look at you,
talking all high and mighty.</b>

18:25.750 --> 18:29.210
<b>I was just getting sick of
how soft you guys are.</b>

18:29.420 --> 18:31.670
<b>Fine then. Kill that boy.</b>

18:31.760 --> 18:34.430
<b>Huh? What do you mean?</b>

18:34.760 --> 18:38.430
<b>A monster is one who has
abandoned being human.</b>

18:38.470 --> 18:40.810
<b>A being severed from
the world of humans.</b>

18:41.060 --> 18:44.730
<b>I saw you help that boy.</b>

18:44.810 --> 18:47.150
<b>That is unacceptable.
You must kill him.</b>

18:47.690 --> 18:50.110
<b>In order to join
the Monster Association</b>

18:50.110 --> 18:53.400
<b>you must work hard to gain our trust.</b>

18:53.700 --> 18:56.740
<b>But you haven't fully let go
of being human.</b>

18:56.910 --> 19:00.200
<b>We don't need any half-hearted types.</b>

19:00.370 --> 19:02.000
<b>We're building
an organization that will</b>

19:02.000 --> 19:04.000
<b>destroy human society
and take control.</b>

19:04.080 --> 19:06.000
<b>We kill kids off like their nothing.</b>

19:06.250 --> 19:09.290
<b>And just now, you even lost
to that mediocre hero.</b>

19:09.500 --> 19:10.880
<b>Even if you were caught off guard</b>

19:10.880 --> 19:12.800
<b>I doubt how useful you'd be in combat.</b>

19:13.340 --> 19:17.430
<b>Hey, I already told you.
Hurry up and go home, kid.</b>

19:18.390 --> 19:21.180
<b>My legs are shaking...
I can't move.</b>

19:22.140 --> 19:23.640
<b>I can't move!!</b>

19:23.850 --> 19:24.810
<b>You idiot!</b>

19:25.060 --> 19:28.440
<b>Don't think someone will help you
because you can't stand up.</b>

19:28.730 --> 19:30.480
<b>No one's gonna help you.</b>

19:30.480 --> 19:32.730
<b>You have to protect yourself.</b>

19:33.110 --> 19:36.160
<b>In moments like this,
the only choice is to become stronger!</b>

19:38.030 --> 19:39.660
<b><i>You need to get strong.</i></b>

19:40.910 --> 19:42.540
<b>Stand up! Tareo!!</b>

20:22.740 --> 20:23.620
<b>Run!!</b>

20:25.200 --> 20:26.580
<b>It's too late.</b>

20:26.910 --> 20:29.670
<b>You're our enemy now.</b>

20:29.960 --> 20:33.460
<b>You call yourself the Hero Hunter,
yet you haven't killed a single soul.</b>

20:33.590 --> 20:36.170
<b>Just like I thought,
you're a spineless wimp.</b>

20:36.840 --> 20:39.550
<b>I don't like your attitude.</b>

20:43.600 --> 20:44.560
<b>Come on!</b>

22:19.780 --> 22:23.160
<b>At last... I've finally tracked them down.</b>

22:23.780 --> 22:28.120
<b>My archenemies I've hunted for years,
the ones most entwined with my fate.</b>

22:29.040 --> 22:32.500
<b>The worst organization in history
that's plotting to wipe out humanity</b>

22:32.500 --> 22:34.250
<b>and reshape the world.</b>

22:35.210 --> 22:40.090
<b>I had started to suspect
their true identity from recent events.</b>

22:40.380 --> 22:43.180
<b>But I could never get a solid lead.</b>

22:44.380 --> 22:47.350
<b>Shibabawa prophesized
that the Earth is in danger.</b>

22:47.720 --> 22:51.310
<b>They are pulling the strings behind
the so-called Monster Association.</b>

22:52.180 --> 22:54.140
<b>They're the true masterminds
behind it all.</b>

22:55.100 --> 22:56.560
<b>No doubt about it!</b>

23:00.280 --> 23:01.110
<b>HOUSE OF TAKOYAKI</b>

23:01.490 --> 23:03.240
<b>It's over for you!</b>

23:03.320 --> 23:04.530
<b>The House of Evolution!</b>

23:05.070 --> 23:06.910
<b>Oh? A customer?</b>

23:07.280 --> 23:08.700
<b>You're a customer, aren't you?</b>

23:09.910 --> 23:11.290
<b>You keep relocating your base</b>

23:11.290 --> 23:13.250
<b>and this time, your front is
a takoyaki stand?</b>

23:13.830 --> 23:15.170
<b>What a joke.</b>

23:15.830 --> 23:17.880
<b>I already know your little schemes.</b>

23:18.210 --> 23:19.250
<b>I won't be fooled.</b>

23:19.800 --> 23:21.250
<b>Hold on, okay?</b>

23:21.380 --> 23:23.170
<b>We're still getting ready.</b>

23:24.800 --> 23:27.590
<b>I am now a hero called Zombieman.</b>

23:27.930 --> 23:29.890
<b>The one with a body that can't die.</b>

23:31.060 --> 23:35.270
<b>Maybe Experimental Sample
No. 66 rings a bell?</b>

23:35.560 --> 23:38.810
<b>Huh? You're a hero who's come to
take down the House of Evolution?</b>

23:39.020 --> 23:42.530
<b>Sorry, but the House of Evolution
has already been destroyed.</b>

23:46.570 --> 23:50.490
<b>Well...you want to come inside?</b>

23:50.830 --> 23:52.540
<b>I've got some free time now.</b>

23:53.410 --> 23:55.960
<b>TO BE CONTINUED</b>

23:56.000 --> 24:00.900
<b>ORGANISM LIMITS</b>
